      "side": 1,
      "message": "I recommend to enable BMI160 interrupt, as it has barely been tested without:\n#define CONFIG_ACCEL_INTERRUPTS\n#define CONFIG_ACCELGYRO_BMI160_INT_EVENT TASK_EVENT_CUSTOM(4)\n\n/* FIFO size is in power of 2. */\n#define CONFIG_ACCEL_FIFO 1024 \u003c\u003c check if it can be bigger or has to be smaller.\n\n/* Depends on how fast the AP boots and typical ODRs */\n#define CONFIG_ACCEL_FIFO_THRES (CONFIG_ACCEL_FIFO / 3)\n\n\nThere is also a change needed in gpio.list (describing the interrupt pin) and in board.c board_init() function to register the interrupt.\n\u003csomething like:\n        /* Enable interrupts from BMI160 sensor. */\n        gpio_enable_interrupt(GPIO_ACCELGYRO3_INT_L);\n\u003e",
